      <h1 class="blog-post__title">My AI knows my resting heart rate. It told me to go all-out.</h1>
      <p class="blog-post__subtitle">The same AI that reads my emails, signs my contracts, and books my Pilates classes also acts as my personal trainer — analyzing training load, HRV, and recovery data.</p>
      <div class="blog-post__meta">
